text.oreville.ghyjxc=§eActions & Stuff§r makes it debut on the Minecraft Marketplace, officially launching on December 24th, 2024!	#
text.oreville.nvkdch=§7Improved compatibility with Add-Ons, and Custom Texture Packs!	#
text.oreville.dsdoxy=§7Fixed bugs (Such as the Villagers Broken Texture in Vanilla Experience (32x) & Banners on Shields), and improved content.	#
text.oreville.iajfbr=§7New 1st person animations for Climbing Ladders, Crawling & Swimming. New 3rd person animation for Creative Flight.	#
text.oreville.xxbool=§7Turtle Helmet is now in the Vanilla Experience (32x).	#
text.oreville.qtwjhq=§7New Painting textures.	#
text.oreville.qizwjk=§7New Parrot idle animations.	#
text.oreville.drpgve=This update primarily focuses on fixing bugs, and improving compatibility with other Add-Ons and Texture Packs. But of course, we couldn't resist sneaking in a couple of extra features and improvements along the way!	#
text.oreville.zniypp=§7Added unique galloping sounds for each armour set to Horse & Zombie Horse.	#
text.oreville.bbjbeq=§7Added Nautilus armour damage sounds.	#
text.oreville.vbqmpj=§7Added custom attack audio for each spear tier.	#
text.oreville.pgoetw=§7Added audio to Spear spin animation.	#
text.oreville.qqdafm=§7Added custom explosion and fuse sounds to Snowy Creeper.	#
text.oreville.eluqvy=§7Added custom jump and hurt sounds to Snowy Slime.	#
text.oreville.vtihyc=§7Added a unique head spin sound for the Parched, similar to the Skeleton.	#
text.oreville.kttrwh=New Features	#
text.oreville.zqxnrj=Audio	#
text.oreville.qynngj=§7Added variants to the on-land armor hurt sounds.	#
text.oreville.zjiwan=§7Added swap item sounds to the Allay and Copper Golem. You will now hear the sound of the item when they swap to it.	#
text.oreville.aezgaj=§7Reduced number of Cow footsteps sounds per cycle from 4 to 2.	#
text.oreville.ixaaeg=§7When using a Spear, it will point in the direction that you are looking now. Looking up will have the Spear point upwards.	#
text.oreville.asxrxn=Improvements	#
text.oreville.inecly=§7Villager Chickens have Villager audio!	#
text.oreville.iroujy=Nametags	#
text.oreville.exzids=§7Spyglass interact audio.	#
text.oreville.wmopjw=Props	#
text.oreville.tyrwrk=§7Fixed Nautilus from using Full Experience saddle in both Vanilla & Custom Experience.	#
text.oreville.jdtkno=§7Fixed an issue causing the Spear charge timer to not reset. This would cause the Spear to be in its lowered by default the next time you equip it.	#
text.oreville.orhncg=§7Fixed Spyglass use animation from continuing to play when switching to another item.	#
text.oreville.kqvaxh=§7Fixed an issue causing the Spear attack animation to play for a split second then suddenly stop when opening doors.	#
text.oreville.zzkjxh=§7Fixed Turtle Helmet having a bugged texture.	#
text.oreville.szpadt=§7Fixed some Full Experience nametags not being available in the Vanilla Experience.	#
text.oreville.oxacfx=§7Fixed dive animations not showing up in multiplayer.	#
text.oreville.rrhhfl=§7Fixed Mace Z fighting when enchanted.	#
text.oreville.zqsafe=§7Fixed missing Lodestone Compass enchantment outline.	#
text.oreville.ytsvhc=§7Fixed items held by Foxes floating in the air above their mouth.	#
text.oreville.ibqjtd=§7Fixed Magma Cube emissive texture.	#
text.oreville.tvjfwu=§7Fixed Iron Golem step particles missing in some subpacks.	#
text.oreville.ygyfga=§7Fixed Zombie armour damage sound.	#
text.oreville.alqxdy=§7Fixed Clown footsteps missing audio.	#
text.oreville.wyjuow=§7Fixed an issue causing first person ladder climb animations to not play when holding a Compass.	#
text.oreville.biovgd=§7Fixed Zombie Nautilus saddle buckle clipping into armour.	#
text.oreville.zgdqhn=§7Fixed weapons in Zombie's head not showing enchantments.	#
text.oreville.zqylut=§7Fixed offhand turning invisible in first person when riding a boat, as well as other issues with the boat not correctly animating.	#
text.oreville.tcgekj=§7Fixed an issue causing the speed run animation to not trigger.	#
text.oreville.embups=§7Fixed an issue causing cats to glow when in Vibrant Visuals.	#
text.oreville.stgvui=§7Fixed an issue causing the Baby Red Tabby Cat to turn fully Red when tamed.	#
text.oreville.zicxae=§7Fixed Villager, Zombie Villager, and Witch textures from clipping at the bottom of their outfits.	#
text.oreville.ecucuu=§7Fixed an issue causing Frogs to not play their Croak animation.	#
text.oreville.zpywlp=§7Fixed Lime Stocking no shading on its entire head rather than just the screen.	#
text.oreville.neazin=§7Fixed Z fighting on Orange Stocking.	#
text.oreville.scnwvo=§7Fixed an issue causing mobs to blink too fast making it look like they don't blink at all.	#
text.oreville.vikuip=§7Fixed Bed block from Z fighting when placed next to another bed.	#
text.oreville.vbppir=§7Fixed legacy Foliage & Grass colour maps so that Add-Ons which use make use of custom biomes don't have black grass.	#
text.oreville.yvwsps=§7Fixed a Minecraft bug causing Elytras to render invisible when Actions & Stuff is applied.	#
text.oreville.yanprh=Bugs Fixed	#
text.oreville.byfuto=Cherry Blossom Dress §7(Spire Trim)	#
text.oreville.hnkxwd=Wildflower Dress §7(Eye Trim)	#
text.oreville.icojpd=Pirate Outfit §7(Tide Trim)	#
text.oreville.mbdijk=Maid Uniform §7(Bolt Trim)	#
text.oreville.wzxmfw=Added 4 new costumes!	#
text.oreville.gdnvfh=Costumes	#
text.oreville.tthzaq=§7Thank you for all of your Actions & Stuff support, we have such a fun time creating this pack and hope you are loving it!	#
text.oreville.eevogy=Enjoy the Update!	#
text.oreville.jsonrw=§7Full Tiny Takeover Drop Support: All the babies!	#
text.oreville.xybljg=§7Improved 3D Items: Coloured Potions, Beds, Banners & More!	#
text.oreville.wffvpa=§7New Nametags, Costumes & Skins!	#
text.oreville.vbevax=§7...and so much more!	#
text.oreville.uczluy=§7Playable Morph Characters!	#
text.oreville.gjoudl=§7New Actions: Flipping, Superhero Landing, Rolling, Sitting!	#
text.oreville.clncuk=§7Directional Swimming & Dolphin's Grace!	#
text.oreville.qzuips=§7Player Movement Overhaul!	#
text.oreville.yuhkef=§7Better Boats: Themed Designs!	#
text.oreville.fzpqnc=§7Optional 3D Models for Tools!	#
text.oreville.duglwp=§7Pack Settings: Customise your Experience!	#
text.oreville.pkoxaq=§7Cherry Biome Mob Variants!	#
text.oreville.jvrdcs=§7Slightly cleaned up Nether Portal texture.	#
text.oreville.saucmo=§7Added outline to enchanted books.	#
text.oreville.xrjhkf=§7Rudolph and Reindeer can now have the Snowy overlay.	#
text.oreville.ojhlqa=§7Adjusted Bed 3D item to have a better fall animation in first person.	#
text.oreville.afcpxu=§7Added various missing Snowy Baby mobs for the Pillager, Skeleton, Witch, Wandering Trader and Iron Golem.	#
text.oreville.pyfxta=§7Added extra names for the Baby Wolf, §cPup§7 & §cPuppers§7.	#
text.oreville.qwgovj=§7Slightly adjusted Plains fog colour to be less saturated.	#
text.oreville.rpuyry=§7Reduced "shakiness" when attacking whilst moving.	#
text.oreville.avpcbo=§7Fixed momentum from falling deaths carrying into respawn animation.	#
text.oreville.cfjojn=§7Arrows wiggle more when they impact a surface.	#
text.oreville.eankti=§7When holding the Spear in the "Charge" state, the character will return to the standing pose after it fatigues, rather than holding it charged forever.	#
text.oreville.innuqg=§7Improved the sync of many baby mob's walk cycles so that they are better attached to the ground.	#
text.oreville.akuqno=§7Made the §cGourden§7 nametag's beating heart (Which is a flame), slightly more emissive.	#
text.oreville.xfhlyf=§7Idle Animation revamp, most idle animations have been slightly altered to improve them.	#
text.oreville.bjzmmx=§7Added some miscellaneous UI textures to improve overall look and feel of the creative inventory panel and some workstation panels. (Crafter, Smithing Table, Brewing Stand)	#
text.oreville.hknwls=§7Added missing UI textures for the frozen, Wither and Horse HUD hearts.	#
text.oreville.xxrlvx=§7Added UI textures for the locator bar.	#
text.oreville.llvjat=§7Improved some UI textures in the settings section as well as the Marketplace section of the game.	#
text.oreville.jfeeku=§7Improved pumpkin hot air balloon design to include stem foliage.	#
text.oreville.xgvrhw=§7Improved Cape animation to be more fluid.	#
text.oreville.eubyep=§7Re-Added the fire overlay. We added this in the 1.6 update then had to remove it in 1.8 as Vibrant Visuals broke the effect. Recently however it is no longer broken, so we can add it back in!	#
text.oreville.gyawzp=§7Updated Flowing Lava texture.	#
text.oreville.pryywk=§7Added a universal nametag for §cFestive§7 & §cHalloween§7 mobs so that all of the seasonal nametags don't need to be individually memorised.	#
text.oreville.jieqyl=§7Water in Vibrant Visuals is now less transparent. We still think it could do with being more opaque, and will look at other techniques to do this without sacrificing Fancy Graphics water.	#
text.oreville.zvyqyy=§7Changed Blaze material to have no shading for a slightly brighter look.	#
text.oreville.csfakg=§7Added Pig sounds to Pig Creeper.	#
