text.oreville.cpklzy=We've been busy adding even more Actions and, (believe it or not) even more Stuff! This update brings many 3D items, hand visibility in first person, glowing enchantments, new sounds, and plenty of small details to make everything feel just a little bit better.	#
text.oreville.mvvvhb=§7Spring to Life Game Drop support!	#
text.oreville.wlgmlo=§7New Chickens, Cows & Pigs!	#
text.oreville.kkagls=§7New Block Textures, Spawn Eggs, and 3D Items!	#
text.oreville.adlvhn=§7Emissive armour trims!	#
text.oreville.wtywyf=§7New Iron Golem and Bee animations!	#
text.oreville.swyytb=§7Wet Wolves!	#
text.oreville.xufgua=§7Large behind the scenes re-works to reduce the Minecraft "texture handle" limitation. (Which can cause Pink Textures to randomly appear.)	#
text.oreville.kicaxj=Spring has Sprung and Actions & Stuff 1.3 brings everything into full bloom! Now with shinier trims, soggier dogs, and Iron Golems who show their softer side. This update includes full support for the Spring to Life Game Drop, and more!	#
text.oreville.smthme=§7Custom designs for all Mob Babies!	#
text.oreville.igugzo=§7Allay, Vex and Creeper VFX revamps!	#
text.oreville.qqsgop=§7Glowing Armour Trims in 32x! (Vanilla Experience)	#
text.oreville.gfztlc=§7New variants for the Allay, Husk, and Enderman.	#
text.oreville.qmmdkn=§7And most importantly, friendly Chicken Jockeys!	#
text.oreville.ojsviu=Our cutest update yet! We've added baby versions of your favourite Mobs, a handful of stylish glow-ups, and even more hidden secrets. Get those name tags ready, and go hanging out with your new furry (& feathery) friends!	#
text.oreville.ineqnj=§7Chase the Skies Support: Happy Ghasts, Ghastlings, and more!	#
text.oreville.wgmkrw=§7Expressions: Facial animations are here - Blinking, Eyes & Eyebrows!	#
text.oreville.ynyzkv=§7Diving: New animations for Diving, Cannon Balling, and Belly Flopping into water!	#
text.oreville.wohrac=§7Boat Wakes: Particle trails from boats!	#
text.oreville.wshbux=§7Wolf Laying & Cat Loafing: Need we say more?	#
text.oreville.lozpqa=§7Wither & Glow Squid: Effect revamps!	#
text.oreville.pqfhcj=§7Nametags: Many new!	#
text.oreville.jkezfx=§7...and so much more!	#
text.oreville.lgqrqf=Chase the skies and make a splash - Actions & Stuff 1.5 launches Happy Ghasts in hot-air balloons, then Cannon Balls into Belly Flops and foamy Boat Wakes. Top it off with some loafing Cats, sleepy Wolves and a stack of shiny new features - and you've got one of our most jam-packed updates to date!	#
text.oreville.gkqyfl=§7The Copper Age Gamedrop is here!	#
text.oreville.yqtrjs=§7...and much more!	#
text.oreville.sdtpmp=§7Copper Golem: A rusty little helper with plenty of character!	#
text.oreville.sggcvw=§7Riding in Style: New riding animations for players and mobs.	#
text.oreville.tkvzrq=§7Elytra Barrel Rolling: Spin left, right, left, right with style!	#
text.oreville.eczhra=§7Speed Potion Running: Dash with a new animation and dust trail!	#
text.oreville.qyrpsw=§7Faithful Vanilla Item: All 3D models in the Vanilla Subpack redesigned to better match Vanilla icons and colors!	#
text.oreville.jpqvri=§7MLG Waterbucket: Landings (Or epic fails) have never looked better! Release!	#
text.oreville.szvywl=§73D Horse Armour: Give your steed the upgrade it deserves!	#
text.oreville.itrweb=§7Nametags Galore: Fun new secrets to discover.	#
text.oreville.vezdjp=Meet the Copper Golem, Ride in Style with new riding animations, experience all new actions, and for the Vanilla fans - a faithful update to all 3D items! We hope you enjoy the update!	#
